{"t": 9929, "msg": {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Ch9tSiRc63ai5f6VVPjSh", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The largest QML files, by line count, are these:\n\n- **Settings.qml (1657 lines):** The settings overlay's core. It holds the shared state and the store, the functions that launch things, the conversation view and the permission prompt. Each sidebar page is handed this overlay as `s`.\n- **Panel.qml (1109 lines):** The bar widget's panel, \"one icon, one panel, one switch\". It has the service switch, the mute control and the notes that explain why a control did nothing.\n- **pages/AgentsPage.qml (1043 lines):** The Agents page. Every agent is drawn as the same card, with model, effort, permission level and project folder.\n- **pages/ListeningPage.qml (838 lines):** The Listening page. It covers the wake word and its engine, the microphone gate, and the verifier that knows your voice.\n- **Chats.qml (586 lines):** The saved conversations view. It has a searchable list grouped as Pinned, Today, This week and Older, with the open chat beside it. You can continue, rename, pin and export a chat from there.\n\nHud.qml (283 lines) and pages/ConversationPage.qml (310 lines) come next."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 929, "cache_read_input_tokens": 27528, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 929}, "output_tokens": 384, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "a172f7f2-88df-4dc4-a0de-c031d22ce3a5", "uuid": "acb91a95-f736-4034-b7dc-3a91a48638e7", "timestamp": "2026-11-18T06:03:45.302Z", "request_id": "req_011Ch9tSiFwayfNVyZ8izuXp"}}
